{"items":[{"str":"presses us within its models of gender.","dir":"ltr","width":185,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,329,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"11","dir":"ltr","width":8,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,330,652],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":1,"height":0,"transform":[7,0,0,7,337,652],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"“The constraints,” Fiske","dir":"ltr","width":113,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,343,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"writes, “are material, economic ones which determine, in an oppres-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,635],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"sive, disempowering way, the limits of the social experience of the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"poor. Oppression is always economic. Yet the everyday culture of the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"oppressed takes the signs of that which oppresses them and uses them","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,593],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"for its own purposes” (157). Here we might want to think about how","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,579],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"classic Hollywood representations of the ultimate in femininity, Mari-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"lyn Monroe, for example, become cult and camp icons for gay male","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"subcultures, who often feature drag performances of these famous","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,537],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Hollywood stars.","dir":"ltr","width":76,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,523],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Fiske also discusses the body as the site of social control (161–62).","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,509],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"To say that the body is a site of social control is to make the point, first","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,495],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"and foremost, that the body is not some kind of natural biological en-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,481],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tity, but an artifact, a socially constructed, socially situated body acted","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,467],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"on by a host of interrelated","dir":"ltr","width":130,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,274,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"power-knowledges","dir":"ltr","width":89,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,279,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f1","hasEOL":false},{"str":". This concept was","dir":"ltr","width":88,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,368,453],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"popularized by the French historian and philosopher Michel Foucault,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,439],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"who analyzed how social formations organize technologies of power","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,425],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"and knowledge (psychiatry, police, prisons, hospitals, medicine, sci-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,411],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ence, universities, governments) that are mapped onto bodies and","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,397],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"construct us as subjects.","dir":"ltr","width":111,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,255,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"12","dir":"ltr","width":8,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,255,386],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[7,0,0,7,263,386],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"The body is no longer conceived of as a","dir":"ltr","width":189,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,267,383],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"bundle of raw instincts and impulses that law, order, and government","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,369],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"are supposed to discipline but that always threatens to break loose;","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,355],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"rather, the technologies of discipline and surveillance construct us as","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,341],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"beings who think we are “repressed” and in need of sexual “libera-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,327],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tion,” in order to create an economy of management and social con-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,313],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"trol. Serial killer movies, which I will be discussing later, illustrate this","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,299],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"managed, surveilled body very well, by linking together representa-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,285],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tions of the police, psychiatry, knowledge, power, and techniques of","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,271],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"surveillance.","dir":"ltr","width":55,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,257],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,199,257],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"13","dir":"ltr","width":8,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,199,260],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Thus, for example, we come to believe that sex is an arena of trans-","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,243],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"gression and liberation as opposed to order and reason; we come to","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,229],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"believe that we must discipline ourselves to be productive citizens, and","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,215],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"yet that abandoning ourselves to sexual impulse is a form of liberation","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,201],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"from that discipline and control.","dir":"ltr","width":145,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,187],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,289,187],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"14","dir":"ltr","width":8,"height":7,"transform":[7,0,0,7,289,190],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[7,0,0,7,297,190],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"As long as we believe this, we have","dir":"ltr","width":156,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,300,187],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"no reason to question the ways the institutions of our society channel","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,173],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"us into narrow corners of liberation and in actuality succeed in “man-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,159],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"aging” us even more. (Rousseau argued that women could never be","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,144,145],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Cultural Studies, Popular Culture, and Pedagogy","dir":"ltr","width":191,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,204,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"| 19 |","dir":"ltr","width":26,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,287,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false}],"styles":{"g_d2896_f2":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f1":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.72,"descent":-0.245,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f3":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false}},"lang":null}